  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e062b4935669f8b1ed021e4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是活动任务。\r\n珍惜每一天，\r\n好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e903ddc3c69d9125cd41ab2724de52dcfbc430073557ccfe6d57807c1cd41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6138b00940d448f720a62e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有忘记领取奖励吧？\r\n小心不要遗漏任何东西，\r\n活用于未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9d81a55a0add816c60a21706ce739260f28f2403f0cc0a798bcaa43eff37fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ddacfb9beead4f1d0afa16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当新芽探头，很快就会迎来\r\n围绕着崭新冠冕的季节了。\r\n来，让我们开始着手准备吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7e0401125bb56bacc3456fae5bfbac46bdaa78a3ef9b84121a0d882502c109",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dd7c3be1304b9ea2c565405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞬间的花舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f1a909c75633b332b5a7aab4d0567d1ec1cb453f920974bdfaa3744a18246b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d5be571a82ae33f463927e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纵然是……终将凋零的花朵，\r\n也要把握有限的当下──！\r\n让我们一起盛开吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66bd14c8f99af407a6312699dfd663696e9105ba4035f7f8b25c75878a3580f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78611a0e826e952414c46c70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前也有帮姐姐代理过事情……\n记得上一次是，演讲。姐姐她，\n一向不愿意谈赛跑相关的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "102a940aba6a3808e0d8fd9076c6a46557b23f9b139ca71844234e33864ea305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9626c5d7b69d3e012c0ae5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐什么也没说。\n只是看着我的脸，微微眯起了眼睛。\n……呵呵，然后就这么结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78a3c577c9d69df4c09e9846c8accabb35f83233b6c2e18232ec1e38239550d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a6f787f53baff2e1fe8607",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f983919e4a02013c188f8629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太精彩了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aebcaafecd53b0fd156ecacd9dadb7b65cc034487d8a76ff14d2f94ea23f791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc8cff73a8d9fba51d98a1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c922c5de8a35921e2086ab355870227069194ca65614c757deb698452d7f0151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9202c898bed918382bafb66f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c922c5de8a35921e2086ab355870227069194ca65614c757deb698452d7f0151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc6d8b5f25e352a7cc2de38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯、嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458f5f2b1b2112dd9cd78441ae379910546e0ea9c6aa5ea9b374fcf7cfac43a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f93ff064f3d97f14775227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯、嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458f5f2b1b2112dd9cd78441ae379910546e0ea9c6aa5ea9b374fcf7cfac43a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a25294a9cfb72d6d83518630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee15be4425539ef6ab145144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45baa9fdd332a1373ffe8456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a14f863ba4ca451888bc08a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在歌曲中包含了对大家地感谢之情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b081a2debe670d88a02e6f83447edebac19b786059db77dad69e56886f8f67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392fa97575f08d065877eb1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上的光辉，请大家看好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59c762cff4ea717d75fa3a11bed47600fd4ef4afc14f4edabbe6e6a3d628f154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bce16c75d76003b699f7f1c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最好的现在，与你一起度过…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa8425fd65754f94bd3b84a21d3d10f30c63f4df2b60ad0730b2247bff6e43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad1d8ae9029ed3a92439c4bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您让我心中找到了光辉。\n那时的相遇现在依然\n是我所骄傲的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b3e9ffc3e465ae03df66e0d659709441be56bd149aff02984362d098f3b061",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:667b051a73eef213476944e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到了学园的历史…\n身体紧张起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4970b7c9a8c669c5880e20e5c7317193499cddac45ff52a664e65643cfd5fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc8ab2867ae67e6426877ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚步很轻盈…\n好像能跳出最好的舞蹈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0def963800fa2a958e44a50ddbea9ff035d0143faebf44ff85f28f395548be7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acdfd38cf6a39e3740a339a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个胸针给予了我勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "338d7d83f2c4935e6d14aab962913593f79a97ba417e0dd30b2e91f2067070d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f960a1c432c80ac56393ac68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发的时候\n要衣冠整齐，挺直腰板。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a316f2228f07a99cf3392b63f90800043fcf094a3e76b053ff6f11c2351c23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c698d768c1948afb5d5762e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦中的服装…华丽的光辉，\n让人看得出神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4edfe3a671fc6a160022e5308c8dbb42bb023ee848ce2aea5ec8d46a04e7334a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b0d57d88527c5e751006e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑白形成的对比。\n使光辉，更加突出…",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b97306c43b53d72079229aa091ae8eb6a01a4ebd5061f73dd02e2ceee81e24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd4abed51890495abfbcf02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以的话，\r\n愿意一起跳支舞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1621a15ed17b38b2ee2ba668be05d1344c71400898c8065e2f300a88c92b09e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91372e92a0ec6a24b5a786f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉身心都振奋了起来，\r\n看来裤装的打扮也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb304ce380633db24078044f25d575ad2d33a5c58d105355ce91a7ed51630d53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c53be08523d54d1bb6c7a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3e9c285c27563027e9fd5dcca1d3139b1f6b2ec940530b09cbf32daeda3f39b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c59bf67937291c988166ddf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是这身衣服的话，好像能更加闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a28286b1d192fa310252b84bcc9482dc234a44f94c20181319e8e610fece268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9744f162e2388682c8336bc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我换好衣服了，\n是要去哪里吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b3b03c1715033e90893d99312d3edd0fac8d08b9b4347c7a78c57922e3c85b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b30f33265d8d14c464bc96f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是平淡无奇的日子，\n也一起好好度过吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12c84b5c295f2539dc694da2d5db395074867353bb7d4f974faf52d22732433",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
